              <li class="flex items-start"><span class="hero-check-circle text-green-500 mr-2 mt-1 flex-shrink-0"></span>Perfect for salads, stir-fries & cooked dishes</li>
              <li class="flex items-start"><span class="hero-check-circle text-green-500 mr-2 mt-1 flex-shrink-0"></span>Rich in vitamins C, K, A, potassium, calcium & iron</li>
